{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/288881-obtaining-praxis","id":288881,"title":"Obtaining PRaxis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-21T14:25:42-07:00","id":288881,"title":"Obtaining PRaxis","content":"Can never find, how exactly does the prince gain praxis?<br /> <br /> is it simply &quot;I'm prince, anyone have a problem with that&quot; or any legalitys involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T14:34:13-07:00","id":288957,"title":"","content":"\u00ccf you can take power and you do so you're the ruler. This can be through political maneuvering, simply having been the first kindred in town threehundred years ago, brute force or even such fun and twisted things as &quot;The werewolves go bonkers if the kindred domain isn't ruled by someone chosen by them.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T14:48:44-07:00","id":288968,"title":"","content":"Ok was just making sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T16:04:57-07:00","id":289074,"title":"","content":"Legalities might be an issue to deal with in a particular domain so that nobody &quot;has a problem with that.&quot; Generally, it is as you said.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T17:06:07-07:00","id":289109,"title":"","content":"Arguably it can be as simple and organic as everyone starts coming to you solve the hard issues and you getting the respect from that.<br /> Do you have particular setting your thinking of?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:08:24-07:00","id":881252,"title":"","content":"Sorry for bumping this OLD thread, but just noticed something in an old Book saying that sometimes as elders thirst spirals out of control they wipe out the entire domain , every now and then, before starving into torpor themselves... and such a situation can go undiscovered for decades or even centurys...<br /> <br /> when a Nomad Coterie comes into a City, think their more likely to pass word to some friends or what.<br /> <br /> and in a case with NO Prince, someone takes Praxis by saying &quot;I am Prince and I designate this or that place as Elysium&quot;<br /> <br /> If he isnt reduced to a pile of ashes in the next few nights he's probaly prince.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T18:31:27-07:00","id":881396,"title":"","content":"For my current setting, most everyone in the city was wiped out by VII (who, in my world, is quite a force of nature, clearing out seemingly random cities overnight). One Kindred, recently in torpor and awakened by the psychic trauma of clanmates dying, salvaged what she could of the city's kindred resources and became Prince. When other vampires began migrating into the city some years later, she was the one to treat with. And her childe, the PC, is the sheriff.<br /> <br /> It was plot device, a way to have the player character do some street-level exploration under her sire's supervision before adding more vampires and inserting politics. <br /> <br /> It seems to me that, in the default setting, a large city would have a reasonable expectation of a decent vampire population, and even if no one actively claimed praxis, no one would let someone take praxis without a seriously compelling reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","user":"Corrigan","date":". 05-03-2016, 09:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","name":"Corrigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T06:26:57-07:00","id":886160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/288881-obtaining-praxis?p=881252#post881252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for bumping this OLD thread, but just noticed something in an old Book saying that sometimes as elders thirst spirals out of control they wipe out the entire domain , every now and then, before starving into torpor themselves... and such a situation can go undiscovered for decades or even centurys...<br /> <br /> when a Nomad Coterie comes into a City, think their more likely to pass word to some friends or what.<br /> <br /> and in a case with NO Prince, someone takes Praxis by saying &quot;I am Prince and I designate this or that place as Elysium&quot;<br /> <br /> If he isnt reduced to a pile of ashes in the next few nights he's probaly prince.</div> </div> </div> </div>It can be as simple as who has the highest status in the city.<br /> If an elder lets some else play prince but has enough power and respect to carve out his own terrtory and say gets to be prince who is really in charge?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-17T10:58:13-07:00","id":892631,"title":"","content":"I think it really depends on the domain. In a large older City, there's probably a pretty well defined hierarchy in place and there are &quot;norms&quot; for who rules. You've got a feudal society where elders already control large sections of the City and exert large influence over a significant number of kindred. In that system, presumably a Prince needs to rule with the assent of a coalition of Elders, or in some way break the power of the other Elders so they can be in charge.<br /> <br /> However, over time the Kindred of the City might have grown sick of the rapid violence that the City descends into everytime a new Prince must rise up. Perhaps they have a formal system where the Eldest rules, or their is an election among certain of the Eldest but they are not allowed to pick one of their numbers. There's a myriad of possibilities, but I think the main thing to keep in mind is that the Prince either needed to be given power or to have taken power, and how they came to hold that position will largely effect the mood of the City.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5106-umoja","name":"Umoja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}